## Command

```shell
biome lint --only=nursery/useTailwindSortedClasses '<TEMP_DIR>/missing_tailwind_stylesheet_errors'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "tailwind": { "stylesheet": "./src/missing.css" },
  "linter": { "rules": { "nursery": { "useTailwindSortedClasses": "error" } } }
}
```

## `src/App.jsx`

```jsx
export const a = <div className="flex p-4" />;

```

